# Committed PUBLIC production defaults for the TAMID backend.
# Client-side/public values ONLY (project URL + publishable/anon key + caller
# origins). RLS protects the data. dotenv loads these WITHOUT overriding any
# real env, so Vercel env / local .env always win.
# NEVER put SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY (service_role) here - it must come from the
# environment; admin writes require it.
